{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not convert MDC snapshot failure into terminal workflow failure.** If `MDC.getCopyOfContextMap()` fails, this routes the failure through `finishInvocation` before plugins or user code start, producing durable `FAILED`. A logging-binding fault can therefore permanently terminate valid work merely because a plugin is configured. Treat capture as best-effort, or complete exceptionally for an invocation retry without creating a durable failure.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77KTKJ","finding_digest":"0133ad3d67132cc709d324b4bff21ae1d7ecb80233125efebfc5cabeb0237650","finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","line":256,"observation_digest":"a6d4b20e811e35b611d117c0cd6495c30a17d60737d1b1183d3ce284648efe9c","observation_id":"aro_v1_u3kledubdy23meorc7am2zevym","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","published_at":"2026-10-08T01:44:34Z","review_id":"arr_v1_mb43dz4wvue7ua4shmyofxjani","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"7ce02425b0b1fb16535b763af5965d08fbe49592","reviewer":"codex","start_line":256,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_pxeydkzkxf7beyejjzidgwb5qi","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T01:44:34Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
